    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba aba e bana baume bakwa Davidi abafyelwe kuli ena mu Hebuloni. Ibeli lyakwe ali ni Amunoni muli Ainoamu umwina Yesireli, uwacibili ni Daniele muli Abigaili umwina Kameli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwacitatu ni Abusalomu muli Maka umwana mwanakashi wakwa Talimai, imfumu ya ku Geshuri. Uwacine ni Adoniya muli Hagiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwacisano, ni Shefatiya muli Abitali. Elyo uwalenga mutanda, ni Itilemu mu mukashi wakwe Egila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bonse mutanda bafyelwe kuli Davidi mu Hebuloni ninshi ali pa bufumu imyaka cine lubali ne myeshi mutanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili ali pa bufumu mu Yerusalemu pa myaka amakumi yatatu na itatu (33). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili aba ebana abafyelwe kuli ena mu Yerusalemu: Shamua, Shobabu, Natani elyo na Solomoni. Abana aba bane ba muli Batisheba umwana mwanakashi wakwa Amieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili na Ibihali, Elishua, Elifeleti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noga, Nefegi, Yafiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elishama, Eliada elyo na Elifeleti, bonse pamo bali pabula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonse aba bali bana bakwa Davidi, ukwabula ukupendelako abana ba mu bakashi bakwe abo ashaupile mu bwinga. Elyo na Tama ewali nkashi yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwana wakwa Solomoni ali ni Reoboamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
